 official portal.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong>\u00a0Where can\u00a0<strong>I check the answer key?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:\u00a0</strong>Candidates can check the answer key notification on the official CSBC website under the <strong data-end=\"454\" data-start=\"436\">\u201canswer key\u201d</strong>\u00a0or\u00a0<strong data-end=\"484\" data-start=\"458\">\u201cLatest Notifications\u201d</strong>\u00a0section</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong>\u00a0In what format<strong> will the answer key be released?</strong></span></li>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The answer key is generally released in <strong data-end=\"619\" data-start=\"605\">PDF format.\u00a0</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong>\u00a0When will the<strong> answer key be released?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer: The answer key is released after the examination</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website of <strong>UPESSC </strong>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The official website of <strong>UPESSC</strong> is <strong>https://www.upessc.up.gov.in/</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><img alt